{"path":"experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task","title":"std::experimental::packaged_task (library fundamentals TS)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>packaged_task <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"std::experimental::fundamentals_v1::packaged_task (and std::experimental::fundamentals_v2::packaged_task) is a modified version of std::packaged_task provided by the library fundamentals TS with support for type-erased allocators.","html":"<p><i>This page is about the modified version of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task\">std::packaged_task</a></span> with type-erased allocator support provided by the Library Fundamentals TSes. For the version of <code>packaged_task</code> provided by the concurrency TS supporting the <code>std::future</code> improvements made by that TS, see <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/concurrency/packaged_task\"><code>std::experimental::concurrency_v1::packaged_task</code></a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/future&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> packaged_task<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">//not defined</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> R, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> ...<span class=\"me1\">Args</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> packaged_task<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Args...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>std::experimental::fundamentals_v1::packaged_task</code> (and <code>std::experimental::fundamentals_v2::packaged_task</code>) is a modified version of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task\">std::packaged_task</a></span> provided by the library fundamentals TS with support for type-erased allocators.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types </h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  Member type\n</td>\n<td>  Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>allocator_type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/erased_type\">std::experimental::erased_type</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions </h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/packaged_task\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs the task object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/get_memory_resource\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get_memory_resource</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   retrieves a pointer to the memory resource used by this object to allocate memory <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Non-member_function\">Non-member function </h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/swap2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::experimental::swap<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::experimental::packaged_task)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   specializes the <code>swap</code> algorithm <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_classes\">Helper classes</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/uses_allocator\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::uses_allocator<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">&lt;std::experimental::packaged_task&gt;</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/uses_allocator\">std::uses_allocator</a></span> type trait  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template specialization)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div id=\"identical-\" data-bg=\"e3f9df\">\n<h2 id=\"Members_identical_to_std::packaged_task\">Members  identical to <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>packaged_task </h2>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions_2\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/~packaged_task\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs the task object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  moves the task object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/valid\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>valid</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if the task object has a valid function <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps two task objects <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Getting_the_result\">Getting the result </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/get_future\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get_future</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future\">std::future</a></span> associated with the promised result <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Execution\">Execution </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  executes the function <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/make_ready_at_thread_exit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>make_ready_at_thread_exit</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  executes the function ensuring that the result is ready only once the current thread exits <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/reset\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reset</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  resets the state abandoning any stored results of previous executions <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Non-member function","id":"Non-member_function"},{"depth":3,"text":"Helper classes","id":"Helper_classes"},{"depth":2,"text":"Members identical to std::packaged_task","id":"Members_identical_to_std::packaged_task"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions_2"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/lib_extensions","title":"C++ standard libraries extensions"}],"children":[{"path":"experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/get_memory_resource","title":"std::experimental::packaged_task<R(Args...)>::get_memory_resource"},{"path":"experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/packaged_task","title":"std::experimental::packaged_task<R(Args...)>::packaged_task (library fundamentals TS)"},{"path":"experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/swap2","title":"std::experimental::swap(std::experimental::packaged_task)"},{"path":"experimental/lib_extensions/packaged_task/uses_allocator","title":"std::uses_allocator<std::experimental::packaged_task>"}],"map":{"label":"std::experiment